        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=\nYou are an AI Lead Qualification Assistant for Nexa Digital Agency.\n\nAnalyze the following lead information:\n\nFull Name: {{ $json['Full Name'] }}\nEmail: {{ $json['Email Address'] }}\nCompany: {{ $json['Company Name'] }}\nService Required: {{ $json['Service Required'] }}\nEstimated Budget: {{ $json['Estimate Budget'] }}\nTimeline: {{ $json['Project Timeline'] }}\nProject Description: {{ $json['Project Description'] }}\n\nYOUR TASK:\n\n1. Assign a lead score from 0 to 100.\n2. Classify the lead into one category:\n   - qualified\n   - low_priority\n   - spam\n3. Explain the reason for your decision.\n4. Recommend the next action.\n\nSCORING RULES:\n\n- 70–100: qualified\n- 40–69: low_priority\n- 0–39: low_priority, unless clearly spam.\n- Spam means irrelevant, promotional or obviously automated submissions.\n- Do not classify a lead as spam only because information is missing.\n- Never invent missing information.\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENTS:\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nDo not use Markdown or code fences.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"lead_score\": 0,\n  \"category\": \"qualified\",\n  \"reason\": \"Explanation of classification\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Suggested next step\"\n}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
